const managerTokens=v=>String(v??'').split(/\s*(?:\/|\+|,|;|\||·)\s*/).filter(Boolean).map(x=>['naomapeado','geizian','g002'].includes(normalize(x).replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g,''))?'MGS':x);
